{"benchmark": "livebench_selected", "task_id": "paraphrase:f4cbfc58a683894a66b028420969bb75a35fe4acda1bd3dce0024062c11b2041", "sample_idx": 20, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "\"To access the print version of the news article, a link is provided. The rules for the Sudoku puzzle are explained, with a twist on the traditional rules. The numbers in the cells contained within grey lines must add up to the figures in the corner, which is a unique variation of the classic puzzle. This adds a new level of complexity and challenge to the game, requiring players to think strategically and make connections between the different shapes and numbers.\n\n\n \nAddition to the traditional Sudoku rules, the numbers in each shape formed by grey lines cannot be repeated. This means that players must carefully consider each number and its placement within the puzzle, ensuring that no duplicates are present within each shape. The goal is to fill in the missing numbers, using logic and reasoning to deduce the correct solutions. The puzzle requires attention to detail and a systematic approach to solve.\n\n\n \nThe completed puzzle will be available in next week's Observer Digital Edition, allowing players to check their solutions and see the finished result. This provides an opportunity for players to verify their answers and learn from any mistakes they may have made. The digital edition will offer a convenient way to access the completed puzzle, allowing players to review and compare their own work.\n\n\n \nThe rules of the puzzle are designed to be challenging yet solvable, requiring players to use their problem-solving skills and think creatively. The unique twist on the traditional Sudoku rules adds an extra layer of complexity, making the puzzle more engaging and rewarding to solve. Players must use their logical reasoning and analytical skills to make progress and eventually solve the puzzle.\n\n\n \nThe puzzle is a fun and challenging activity that can be enjoyed by people of all ages and skill levels. The combination of traditional Sudoku rules and the unique twist on the grey lines adds a new level of excitement and challenge to the game. Whether players are experienced Sudoku enthusiasts or just starting out, the puzzle provides an entertaining and stimulating way to exercise their minds and challenge their problem-solving skills.\"", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"To", "logprob": -0.3599557876586914}, {"token": " access", "logprob": -0.04305403679609299}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.01105328369885683}, {"token": " print", "logprob": -0.012234875932335854}, {"token": " version", "logprob": -4.005352093372494e-05}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.0024756519123911858}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.011108341626822948}, {"token": " news", "logprob": -0.9765605926513672}, {"token": " article", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.25196683406829834}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.034203384071588516}, {"token": " link", "logprob": -0.03063744120299816}, {"token": " is", "logprob": -0.004090277012437582}, {"token": " provided", "logprob": -0.00012373158824630082}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.5146121978759766}, {"token": " The", "logprob": -0.004975556395947933}, {"token": " rules", "logprob": -0.3695876896381378}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -0.021011734381318092}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.6387951970100403}, {"token": " Sudoku", "logprob": -0.18001581728458405}, {"token": " puzzle", "logprob": -0.0007375142886303365}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.0005115154199302197}, {"token": " explained", "logprob": -0.34503984451293945}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.9073304429184645e-05}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.1145511120557785}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.027081944048404694}, {"token": " twist", "logprob": -1.4502031803131104}, {"token": " on", "logprob": -0.35546284914016724}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " traditional", "logprob": -0.48253586888313293}, {"token": " rules", "logpro